each R24 and R25 is independently H, C1-C6 alkyl, C1-C6 haloalkyl, C2-C6 alkenyl, C3-C6 alkynyl, C3-C6 cycloalkyl, C3-C6 halocycloalkyl, C2-C6 alkylcarbonyl, C2-C6 alkoxycarbonyl, C2-C6 (alkylthio)carbonyl, C4-C8 cycloalkylcarbonyl, C4-C8 cycloalkoxycarbonyl, C4-C8 (cycloalkylthio)carbonyl, C2-C6 alkoxy(thiocarbonyl) or C4-C8 cycloalkoxy(thiocarbonyl);
