Step C: Preparation of (2-chloro-4-fluorophenyl)[5-[4-(cyclopropylmethoxy)-2,6-difluorophenyl]-1,3-dimethyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl]methanone
To a mixture of (2-chloro-4-fluorophenyl)[5-(2,6-difluoro-4-hydroxyphenyl)-1,3-dimethyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl]methanone (i.e. the product of Step B) (0.090 g, 0.24 mmol) and potassium carbonate (0.065 g, 0.44 mmol) in N,N-dimethylformamide (2 ml) was added (iodomethyl)cyclopropane (0.051 g, 0.28 mmol). After 5 h, the reaction mixture was diluted with water and extracted with ethyl acetate (2×50 mL). The combined organic layers were dried over sodium sulfate, filtered and concentrated under reduced pressure. The resulting material was purified by column chromatography on silica gel eluting with 30% ethyl acetate in petroleum ether to provide the title compound as an off-white solid (0.087 g).
